-- Blackrock Depths: SmartAI and creature texts the dungeon was missing. Source: 3.3.5 or 4.3.4, whichever has more rows for the creature
-- (the two sets agree where both exist; 3.3.5 is the primary reference for this dungeon). Columns are identical to SkyFire's. event_flags are kept, minus the 4.3.4
-- WHILE_CHARMED bit (0x200), which is the 40-man difficulty bit in SkyFire. Every spell used was checked against the 5.4.8 spell data.
-- Creatures with a C++ ScriptName keep it. Safe to run twice: DELETE before INSERT by key.

-- Enable SmartAI only where no C++ script is bound.
UPDATE `creature_template` SET `AIName` = 'SmartAI' WHERE `entry` IN (8889, 8890, 8891, 8892, 8893, 8894, 8895, 8896, 8897, 8898, 8899, 8900, 8901, 8902, 8904, 8906, 8908, 8909, 8910, 8911, 8912, 8913, 8914, 8915, 8916, 8920, 8921, 8922, 8982, 8983, 9016, 9017, 9024, 9025, 9034, 9035, 9036, 9038, 9040, 9041, 9042, 9056, 9319, 9499, 9500, 9537, 9543, 9545, 9547, 9554, 9956, 10043) AND `ScriptName` = '';

